  <Title>k__BackingField: "Module 3 Complete \u2014 Well Done"
  <Description>k__BackingField: Congratulations on completing the Route Optimisation
    module. You have learned that efficiency in a warehouse is not about moving faster.
    it is about moving less. Every metre of unnecessary travel is a cost that compounds
    across every picker, every shift, every day. The habits you have built here,
    plan before you move, sequence your zones, batch intelligently, re-route calmly,
    will make you a measurably more efficient picker and a more valuable member of
    this team. You have now completed all training modules in the Warehouse Operations
    series.
  <VoiceOver>k__BackingField: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9976ad9e48bb4844ca09b7b2a1347627, type: 3}
